# Cairo: The Cairo Programming Language book (Starknet, 2.x); requirements/languages/cairo.md
name     cairo
keyword  fn let mut const if else match loop while break continue return struct enum trait impl mod
keyword  use pub ref self Self as of type extern nopanic
type     felt252 u8 u16 u32 u64 u128 u256 usize bool ByteArray Array ContractAddress
builtin  true false None Some Ok Err assert panic println
line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
sigil    #    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
hook     rust
